      <h2>Three things to check before buying</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="swatch">01 / TINT</div>
          <h3>A tint that suits your skin</h3>
          <p>Tinted mineral sunscreen contains pigments that can help the product blend more naturally. Look for a shade that matches your skin tone without needing to apply too little product.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="swatch" style="background:#d5d9c5">02 / TEXTURE</div>
          <h3>A finish you enjoy</h3>
          <p>Fluid and lotion textures may feel lighter, while creams can feel richer. If your skin gets dry in air conditioning, consider how the formula wears over your moisturizer.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="swatch" style="background:#e9c6ae">03 / PROTECTION</div>
          <h3>Broad-spectrum SPF 30+</h3>
          <p>Choose broad-spectrum sunscreen with SPF 30 or higher. A flattering finish matters, but it should not come at the cost of applying enough sunscreen.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

